      // (BT core profiles) in this witness tree.  Drives the SEP
      // registry (declare SBC + AAC), the DUP_CODEC + subset refusals,
      // the AVDTP FSM (SET_CONFIGURATION -> OPEN -> START -> SUSPEND
      // -> CLOSE), and the illegal-edge refusals.  PLACEMENT AFTER
      // bt_pairing_channel_witness_call IS DELIBERATE -- A2DP is the
      // first BT profile above the R39.M4 pairing tree.
      //
      // Fingerprint: R39 A2DP OK
      // ============================================================
      a2dp_witness_call:
