      //
      // Body in tests/kernel/drivers/bt/a2dp_bridge_synth.pdx.  Wires
      // an A2DP SEP row to a KIND_PCM_STREAM cap slot (R33 audio
      // graph); exercises attach / duplicate refusal / decode-encode
      // frame contract / direction mismatch / frame size refusal /
      // underrun counter / detach.  PLACEMENT AFTER a2dp_witness_call
      // IS DELIBERATE -- the bridge consumes A2DP SEP row-ids
      // published by the a2dp module.
      //
      // Fingerprint: R39 A2DP BRIDGE OK
      // ============================================================
      a2db_witness_call:
