      // ============================================================
      // R39.M5-003 (#1341): A2DP retransmission + resync witness.
      //
      // Body in tests/kernel/drivers/bt/a2dp_rtx_synth.pdx.  Drives
      // per-SEP retx accounting (loss counter + EXCEEDED ceiling),
